  ('en', 'faq.hero_tagline', 'Got questions?'),
  ('en', 'faq.hero_title', 'Frequently Asked Questions'),
  ('en', 'faq.breadcrumb_home', 'Home'),
  ('en', 'faq.breadcrumb', 'FAQ'),
  ('en', 'faq.cat1', 'FAQ'),
  ('en', 'faq.cat2', 'Rules'),
  ('en', 'faq.cat3', 'Booking'),
  ('en', 'faq.cat4', 'Stay Plans'),
  ('en', 'faq.cat5', 'For International Students'),
  ('en', 'faq.cat6', 'Contact & Support'),
  ('en', 'faq.categories_title', 'Categories'),
  ('en', 'faq.cta_title', 'Still have questions?'),
  ('en', 'faq.cta_desc', 'Our team is here to help. Get in touch and we''ll respond within 24 hours.'),
  ('en', 'faq.cta_btn', 'Contact Us'),
  ('en', 'faq.q1', 'How do I book a room at MillionStay?'),
  ('en', 'faq.a1', 'You can browse available rooms on our Location page and submit an enquiry or application directly from each listing. Our team will get back to you within 24 hours to confirm availability and guide you through the next steps.'),
  ('en', 'faq.q2', 'What is included in the rent?'),
  ('en', 'faq.a2', 'All our rooms include Wi-Fi, utilities (electricity, water, gas), weekly cleaning of common areas, and access to shared kitchen and laundry facilities. Some properties also include breakfast or additional services — please check individual listings for details.'),
  ('en', 'faq.q3', 'Can I view the room before booking?'),
  ('en', 'faq.a3', 'Yes! We offer both in-person and virtual tours. Contact us to arrange a convenient time. For international students arriving from overseas, we can organise a detailed video walkthrough so you can feel confident before you arrive.'),
  ('en', 'faq.q4', 'What is the minimum stay period?'),
  ('en', 'faq.a4', 'Our minimum stay is typically 4 weeks (1 month). We offer flexible monthly rolling contracts with no long-term lease commitment, which is ideal for students on temporary or student visas.'),
  ('en', 'faq.q5', 'Is there a bond or security deposit?'),
  ('en', 'faq.a5', 'Yes, a bond equivalent to 4 weeks'' rent is required upon signing. This is held in accordance with Victorian tenancy law and returned at the end of your stay, provided the room is left in good condition.'),
  ('en', 'faq.q6', 'Do you cater to international students?'),
  ('en', 'faq.a6', 'Absolutely — international students are our core community. We have multilingual staff (Korean, Japanese, Chinese, Thai), and our rooms are designed to make your transition to Melbourne as comfortable as possible.'),
  ('en', 'faq.q7', 'What documents do I need to provide?'),
  ('en', 'faq.a7', 'Typically you will need a copy of your passport, student ID or enrolment letter, and proof of funds or a guarantor letter. Our team will advise you on exactly what''s needed during the application process.'),
  ('en', 'faq.q8', 'Are bills included in the weekly price?'),
  ('en', 'faq.a8', 'Yes, electricity, water, gas, and high-speed internet are all included in your weekly rent. There are no hidden costs. The price you see on the listing is what you pay.'),
  ('en', 'faq.q9', 'Can I have guests stay overnight?'),
  ('en', 'faq.a9', 'Overnight guests are allowed with advance notice to management, up to a maximum of 2 consecutive nights. Extended stays must be approved and may incur an additional charge. Please refer to our House Rules for full details.'),
  ('en', 'faq.q10', 'How do I pay my rent?'),
  ('en', 'faq.a10', 'Rent is payable weekly or fortnightly via bank transfer or credit card. You will receive an invoice through your online portal each billing cycle. Automatic payment reminders are sent 3 days before each due date.'),
  ('en', 'auth.welcome_back', 'Welcome back'),
  ('en', 'auth.login_subtitle', 'Sign in to manage your Melbourne room'),
  ('en', 'auth.session_expired', 'Your session has expired. Please sign in again.'),
  ('en', 'auth.email_label', 'Email address'),
  ('en', 'auth.email_placeholder', 'your@email.com'),
  ('en', 'auth.password_label', 'Password'),
  ('en', 'auth.password_placeholder_login', 'Enter your password'),
  ('en', 'auth.forgot_password', 'Forgot password?'),
